      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRUNO CHOCOLATE (8) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fifth (20.75) at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Has good speed and will be prominent from out wide. Looks the one to beat on his best form. LET'S GO PIES (4) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish second (20.29) at this track in a Other over 342m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings nine times from 16 starts. Leading chance. THUNDERING LADY (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fifth (20.45) in a Other at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Good beginner and aided by a handy draw. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. KOTA LAMBAI (1) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
